doctype html
html(lang='en')

    head
        meta(charset='utf-8')
        meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
        meta(name='description', content='A synchronized greenhouse RGB-D strawberry dataset with 3,758 frames, 14,286 instances, bounding boxes, five keypoints, ripeness, and occlusion annotations.')
        meta(name='theme-color', content='#17364d')
        meta(property='og:type', content='website')
        meta(property='og:title', content='Strawberry RGB-D Dataset')
        meta(property='og:description', content='3,758 synchronized RGB-D frames with 14,286 instance annotations and 71,430 anatomical keypoints.')
        meta(property='og:url', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        meta(property='og:image', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/assets/og-strawberry-dataset.jpg')
        meta(name='twitter:card', content='summary_large_image')
        title Strawberry RGB-D Dataset | Agricultural Computer Vision

        link(rel='canonical', href='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        link(rel='icon', type='image/png', href='assets/strawberry-favicon.png')
        include includes/css.pug

    body
        a.skip-link(href='#main-content') Skip to content

        include includes/navbar.pug

        main#main-content
            header#overview.research-hero
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .project-label Train/validation release · July 2026
                    .row.g-5.align-items-center
                        .col-lg-6
                            h1 A synchronized RGB-D strawberry dataset for real greenhouse perception
                            p.hero-abstract
                                | The current release contains 3,758 paired frames and 14,286 annotated strawberry instances. Every instance combines a bounding box, five anatomical keypoints, a ripeness category, and an occlusion category.
                            .hero-actions
                                a.btn.btn-research(href='https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ul6L7jNT5VSTEdgTZroezA?pwd=pgna', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer') Download dataset
                                a.btn.btn-outline-research(href='#statistics') Explore release statistics
                            dl.project-metadata
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Modalities
                                    dd RGB · aligned depth · post-processed depth · raw depth · LabelMe JSON
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Research tasks
                                    dd Object detection · keypoint estimation · attribute recognition · RGB-D perception
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Capture system
                                    dd Four Intel RealSense D435I camera units
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Image resolution
                                    dd 1280 × 720 pixels
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Dataset split
                                    dd Train 3,006 frames · Validation 752 frames
                        .col-lg-6
                            figure.research-figure.hero-figure
                                .figure-frame.figure-frame--clean
                                    img(src='assets/dataset-annotation-overview.webp', alt='Representative greenhouse RGB frame with strawberry bounding boxes, five landmark types, ripeness categories, and occlusion categories', width='1800', height='1080', fetchpriority='high')
                                figcaption
                                    span.figure-number Figure 1.
                                    |  Real annotation overlay from train/0238; category IDs are shown exactly as stored.

            section#statistics.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 01
                        div
                            p.section-type Release audit
                            h2 Dataset snapshot
                    p.section-summary
                        | Statistics were recomputed from the reorganized train/validation release. Counts cover every synchronized modality and the per-image camera calibration mapping.
                    .dataset-stat-grid
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Frames
                            strong 3,758
                            p Synchronized RGB-D samples
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Instances
                            strong 14,286
                            p Strawberry bounding boxes
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Landmarks
                            strong 71,430
                            p Five keypoints per instance
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Storage
                            strong 7.11 GB
                            p 18,795 files in total
                    .integrity-grid
                        article.integrity-item
                            span.integrity-value 100%
                            div
                                h3 Cross-modal pairing
                                p 3,758 complete RGB, label, aligned-depth, post-processed-depth, and raw-depth sets.
                        article.integrity-item
                            span.integrity-value 100%
                            div
                                h3 Annotation structure
                                p All 14,286 instances contain one each of Cut, Top, Bottom, Left, and Right.
                        article.integrity-item
                            span.integrity-value 100%
                            div
                                h3 Calibration mapping
                                p All 3,758 image records map to one of four RealSense camera calibration files.
                    .audit-note
                        div
                            strong Reproducible release summary
                            p The complete machine-readable count table and observed category values are included with the site.
                        a.text-link(href='assets/dataset-summary.json', target='_blank') Open statistics JSON

            section#composition.paper-section.paper-section--alt
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 02
                        div
                            p.section-type Dataset analysis
                            h2 Composition and label balance
                    p.section-summary
                        | The release now uses a fixed train/validation split. Training contains 3,006 frames and validation contains 752 frames, preserving the full set of synchronized RGB-D records.
                    figure.research-figure.data-figure
                        .figure-frame.figure-frame--clean
                            img(src='assets/dataset-distributions.webp', alt='Charts showing frame and strawberry instance counts by train and validation split, plus ripeness, occlusion, and keypoint visibility distributions', width='1800', height='1250', loading='lazy')
                        figcaption
                            span.figure-number Figure 2.
                            |  Release-wide counts. Ripeness and occlusion use their stored numeric IDs; semantic class names are not inferred without a finalized codebook.
                    .composition-grid
                        .table-responsive.collection-table-wrap
                            table.collection-table
                                caption Train/validation sample and instance counts
                                thead
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='col') Split
                                        th(scope='col') Frames
                                        th(scope='col') Share
                                        th(scope='col') Instances
                                        th(scope='col') Inst./frame
                                tbody
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Train
                                        td 3,006
                                        td 80.0%
                                        td 11,502
                                        td 3.83
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Validation
                                        td 752
                                        td 20.0%
                                        td 2,784
                                        td 3.70
                                tfoot
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Total
                                        td 3,758
                                        td 100%
                                        td 14,286
                                        td 3.80
                        aside.label-summary
                            p.section-type Observed labels
                            h3 Attribute distribution
                            dl
                                .label-row
                                    dt Ripeness 0
                                    dd 4,957
                                        span 34.7%
                                .label-row
                                    dt Ripeness 1
                                    dd 9,329
                                        span 65.3%
                                .label-row
                                    dt Occlusion 0
                                    dd 9,278
                                        span 64.9%
                                .label-row
                                    dt Occlusion 1
                                    dd 5,008
                                        span 35.1%
                            p.label-footnote Keypoint visibility: v0 = 774, v1 = 10,062, v2 = 60,594.

            section#protocol.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 03
                        div
                            p.section-type Data specification
                            h2 Modalities and annotation protocol
                    p.section-summary
                        | Every four-digit sample ID identifies one synchronized record inside either train or validation. Post-processed aligned depth is used for the 3D visualization below, with calibration selected from the release-wide image-to-camera mapping.
                    .table-responsive.protocol-table-wrap
                        table.protocol-table
                            thead
                                tr
                                    th(scope='col') Signal
                                    th(scope='col') Representation
                                    th(scope='col') Release count
                                    th(scope='col') Intended use
                            tbody
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') RGB
                                    td 1280 × 720 PNG
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Appearance, localization, and attribute recognition
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Aligned depth
                                    td 16-bit depth PNG aligned to color
                                    td 3,758
                                    td RGB-D fusion and metric geometry
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Processed depth
                                    td Spatial, temporal, and hole-filled aligned depth
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Stable visualization and downstream geometry
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Raw depth
                                    td Original 16-bit depth PNG
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Reprocessing and sensor-level studies
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Instance label
                                    td LabelMe JSON
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Boxes, five keypoints, ripeness, and occlusion
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Calibration map
                                    td Per-image XLSX mapping plus four camera JSON files
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Select the correct camera intrinsics for metric reconstruction
                    .protocol-record
                        .protocol-code
                            span.protocol-note-label Instance record
                            code { bbox, Cut, Top, Bottom, Left, Right, ripeness, occlusion }
                        p Visibility is stored per keypoint as 0, 1, or 2. Ripeness and occlusion use observed values 0 and 1.

            section#visualizations.paper-section.paper-section--alt
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 04
                        div
                            p.section-type Qualitative inspection
                            h2 Annotation and depth visualization
                    p.section-summary
                        | Both views below use the same representative sample. The first shows the complete instance-level label overlay; the second uses the labels and subject depth to retain strawberries, foliage, and nearby background in a colorized 3D point cloud.
                    .visual-stack
                        figure.research-figure.visual-figure
                            .figure-frame.figure-frame--clean
                                img(src='assets/dataset-annotation-overview.webp', alt='Complete instance annotation overlay for representative training sample 0238', width='1800', height='1080', loading='lazy')
                            figcaption
                                span.figure-number Figure 3a.
                                |  Seven labeled instances with bounding boxes, category IDs, and five anatomical landmark types. Filled points denote visibility 2; outlined points denote visibility 1.
                        figure.research-figure.visual-figure
                            .figure-frame.figure-frame--clean.figure-frame--dark.pointcloud-viewer
                                .pointcloud-toolbar
                                    div
                                        span.pointcloud-eyebrow Interactive foreground reconstruction
                                        strong
                                            | train / 0238 ·
                                            span#pointcloudPointCount Preparing dense cloud…
                                    button#pointcloudReset.pointcloud-reset(type='button') Reset view
                                .pointcloud-stage
                                    canvas#pointcloudViewer(
                                        tabindex='0',
                                        role='img',
                                        aria-label='Interactive RGB-colored strawberry point cloud. Drag to rotate, shift-drag to pan, and use the wheel to zoom.',
                                        data-source='assets/dataset-pointcloud-data.json'
                                    )
                                    #pointcloudLoading.pointcloud-loading(role='status') Loading real point-cloud data…
                                    img#pointcloudFallback.pointcloud-fallback(src='assets/dataset-pointcloud.webp', alt='Static RGB-colored 3D point cloud fallback for training sample 0238', width='1800', height='1120', hidden)
                                .pointcloud-help
                                    span Drag to rotate
                                    span Shift/right-drag to pan
                                    span Wheel or pinch to zoom
                                    span Arrow keys · +/− · R
                                noscript
                                    img(src='assets/dataset-pointcloud.webp', alt='Static RGB-colored 3D point cloud for training sample 0238', width='1800', height='1120', loading='lazy')
                            figcaption
                                span.figure-number Figure 3b.
                                |  Interactive foreground-filtered point cloud reconstructed with mapped color-camera intrinsics. Rotate, pan, and zoom freely; a label-aware crop and 0.220–0.500 m subject-depth window retain strawberries, foliage, and nearby background while excluding distant artifacts.

            section#resources.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 05
                        div
                            p.section-type Availability
                            h2 Resources
                    .resources-layout
                        .download-record
                            .resource-status
                                span.status-indicator(aria-hidden='true')
                                | Dataset available
                            h3 Strawberry RGB-D dataset package
                            p The current release is distributed through Baidu Netdisk with train/validation partitions, synchronized depth variants, and per-image camera calibration mapping.
                            a.btn.btn-research(href='https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ul6L7jNT5VSTEdgTZroezA?pwd=pgna', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer') Open dataset download
                            p.access-code Access code:
                                code pgna
                        .resource-index
                            dl
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Dataset
                                    dd
                                        span.resource-available Available
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Statistics
                                    dd
                                        a(href='assets/dataset-summary.json', target='_blank') Release summary JSON
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Associated paper
                                    dd To be added
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Source code
                                    dd To be added
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Dataset license
                                    dd To be specified
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Citation
                                    dd To be added with publication details

        include includes/footer.pug
        include includes/scripts.pug
